<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 2: </span>PPL on the Wikitext test set for 55M and 340M IIET across varying iteration steps <math id="S3.F2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>. Dashed lines indicate <span id="S3.F2.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#5E35B1;">Transformer++</span> and <span id="S3.F2.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;">PCformer</span> performance at corresponding parameter scales. Note that IIET’s FLOPs is nearly <math id="S3.F2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r+1</annotation></semantics></math> times of Transformer++.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
